{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026KxlGVoRZDL1795773771.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>入境處拘捕一對情侶，涉嫌無合法授權改動旅遊證件，被捕女子早前聲稱，與男友遭日本拒絕入境並遣返，原因是她的特區護照有缺頁，但政府化驗所的化驗結果顯示，缺頁是人為造成。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_20261127_QQ.PASSPORT.CLEAN.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026BTNmaEXiCF1795774655.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>護照的頁數不完整，是被視為護照遭損壞，會被目的地拒絕入境，甚至不能登上航機。</p><p></p><p>護照的規格，是由國際民航組織(ICAO)制定，接近200個成員國，須根據組織的9303號文件定出的規格，簽發機讀護照，即可以透過光學字符識別的護照。規格涵蓋護照的大小和個人資料等。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_20261127_QQ.PASSPORT.CLEAN_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026k6jp9AYVuk1795774726.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>而受損壞的護照是指有水漬、有打孔、內頁有非官方標記、頁數不完整和晶片受損等。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_20261127_QQ.PASSPORT.CLEAN_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20268IPAs04noH1795774743.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>內地傳媒報道，一名四川男子2017年在泰國曼谷機場，準備轉飛新加坡，但被拒絕登機，原因是護照有相片和個人資料的一頁，被撕破約1厘米，他最終要返回中國。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_20261127_QQ.PASSPORT.CLEAN_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202608NqtObTYj1795774594.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>本港入境處提醒市民，特區護照是重要的旅行證件，應妥善保管，切勿非法改動。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/programme/17/episode/12843-%E4%B8%AD%E5%9C%8B%E5%A4%AA%E7%A9%BA%E7%AB%99%E9%A6%96%E4%BD%8D%E5%A4%96%E7%B1%8D%E8%88%AA%E5%A4%A9%E5%93%A1%E9%BD%8A%E5%B0%9A%E9%98%BF%E9%87%8C\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">點擊觀看其他集數</a></p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1208724-%E7%89%B9%E5%8D%80%E8%AD%B7%E7%85%A7%E7%BC%BA%E9%A0%81%E6%A1%88%E5%BB%B6%E4%BC%B8%E9%96%B1%E8%AE%80%E8%AD%B7%E7%85%A7%E6%90%8D%E5%A3%9E%E6%87%89%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%BE%A6\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">特區護照缺頁案‧延伸閱讀｜護照損壞應怎麼辦？</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T11:23:56.769356+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":396,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T10:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T12:17:16.505136+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T11:17:18.760859+00:00","content_hash":"a7186091954a5b14e4a736a57d6c711c0c93a8fe65cea4cef5a2ac44370eb01c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T11:23:56.769356+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}